<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 107%;">Hi <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span>&nbsp;</span></font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#181818">&lt;insert contact name&gt; </font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></font></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">,</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 107%;"><span style="color:red"><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">I want to thank you
again for the opportunity to meet with me and the members of your service team
on <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span>&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Monday,
MM/DD/YYYY</span>. <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></span> We enjoyed meeting you and learning more about your business
objectives for the coming year.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Based on what you have expressed, we feel we can best
support you by implementing the following strategies listed below. <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span> &lt;Insert Service Plan Table&gt; <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your
Insperity service team welcomes the opportunity to assist you with your HR
growth and to support you in the accomplishment of your business goals. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span> I have attached your Service Team
Contact Sheet so that you can identify the various Insperity Team Members that
support you and <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</font></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Account.Name}</span>.</font></p>

<p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I will contact you periodically to ensure that you are
receiving the caliber of service from Insperity that you expect and to learn if
any additional resources may be of benefit to your company at that time.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please
feel free to contact me at any time with questions and/or concerns.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Kind regards,</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 107%;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span><font color="#181818"> &lt;insert email signature&gt; </font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></font></span></span></p><span style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"></span><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
